格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Blue: a TUI is not a package, it is a Cordis plugin tree — a modern terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness with hot-swappable render, interaction, and command plugins.","id":"gh:1338641236","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"blue","slug":"dsh-blue/blue","topics":["ai-agent","cli","coding-agent","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","llm","plugin","plugin-architecture","terminal","terminal-ui","tui","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Blue: a TUI is not a package, it is a Cordis plugin tree — a modern terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" with hot-swappable render, interaction, and command plugins."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Blue"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Blue has become Mayfly** — a dsh-based multi-agent terminal. This repository is archived and no "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"longer maintained; the project now lives at **may-fly.dev**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Blue is an interactive terminal UI for\nDeepSeek Harness (`dsh`).\nIt is an out-of-tree Cordis bundle "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"over `dsh-base`, built against Harness\n`0.1.2-alpha.3`. Blue `0.2.0-alpha.1` deliberately uses the s"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ame plugin\nmodel as dsh Web: plugins are ordinary Cordis siblings and consume native dsh\nservices di"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"gin\nmodel as dsh Web: plugins are ordinary Cordis siblings and consume native dsh\nservices directly."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Blue renders Markdown tables, closed Mermaid fences in assistant messages,\nand renderer-neutral line"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", point, bar, sparkline, and heatmap nodes directly in\nthe terminal, with width-safe source or text "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ar, sparkline, and heatmap nodes directly in\nthe terminal, with width-safe source or text fallbacks."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Plugin model"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A plugin declares the services it needs with `inject`, then uses them from its\nCordis context:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- `ctx.commands`, `ctx.sessionProjections`, `ctx.tools`, and the rest of\nthe documented dsh services"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" are used directly.\n- `ctx.bluePanes`, `ctx.blueStatus`, `ctx.blueOverlays`, and\n`ctx.blueEditorExte"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"nsions` are the only Blue-specific UI contribution\nservices.\n- `ctx.blueCurrentAgent.current()` retu"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"rns the exact Agent selected by this\nBlue frontend when an Agent-scoped native service needs it.\n- E"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"very registration belongs to the caller's Cordis Fiber. Unloading the\nplugin removes its commands an"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"elongs to the caller's Cordis Fiber. Unloading the\nplugin removes its commands and UI contributions."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"There is no Blue plugin manifest, capability negotiation, adapter facade,\nprivate plugin realm, or s"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"eparate plugin-author CLI. Blue's own features and\nexternal plugins register through the same servic"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"rate plugin-author CLI. Blue's own features and\nexternal plugins register through the same services."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Plugins always return ordinary renderer-neutral nodes. Blue automatically\nwindows large `list` nodes"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" and delays hidden responsive branches, so plugins\ndo not manage viewport ranges, overscan, renderer"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" caches, or scroll\ncontrollers. Plugins still own database and network fetching."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Prerequisites are Node `^22.19 || >=24` and pnpm 11."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Or install the standalone launcher, which includes the tested dsh runtime:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` before first run. `/help` lists the active commands\nand key bindings."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Only `packages/core` imports pi-tui or owns raw terminal behavior. The API and\nUI packages define re"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nderer-neutral nodes and direct registries. App selects\nthe current Agent and coordinates startup, w"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"hile transcript and interaction\nconsume native dsh services and publish UI contributions."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"See the architecture, the service seams,\nand the developer manual."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Blue has moved to Mayfly. Questions, feedback, and bug reports belong in Mayfly's issues."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
